---
import '@fontsource/bricolage-grotesque/latin-700.css';
import '@fontsource/bricolage-grotesque/latin-800.css';
import '@fontsource/source-sans-3/latin-400.css';
import '@fontsource/source-sans-3/latin-600.css';
import '../styles/site.css';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import Calculator from '../components/Calculator.astro';
import { getSiteConfig } from '../../site-config.mjs';
const config = getSiteConfig();
const canonical = new URL('/', Astro.site);
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Label roll calculator: how many rolls to order | Rollwise</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Work out how many label rolls to order for your next small batch. Rounds up to whole labels and whole rolls, adds an allowance for setup and misprints, and runs entirely in your browser." />
    <meta name="robots" content={config.robots} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1b2a2f" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a href="#main" class="skip">Skip to calculator</a>
    <SiteHeader mode={config.mode} />
    <main id="main" class="home">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="shell hero-inner">
          <div class="intro">
            <h1 id="hero-title">How many label rolls does this batch need?</h1>
            <p class="lede">Enter your batch and your roll size. Rollwise rounds up to whole labels and whole rolls, adds a small allowance for setup and misprints, and takes off the rolls already on your shelf.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="hero-cta" href="#planner-title">Plan your label run <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
              <p class="trust">No inputs leave your browser. No account, no ads, no tracking.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <svg class="hero-art" viewBox="0 0 600 520" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <g class="hero-marks" fill="none" stroke="#ead9c4" stroke-width="1.5">
              <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="9" /><path d="M30 12v36M12 30h36" />
              <circle cx="570" cy="30" r="9" /><path d="M570 12v36M552 30h36" />
              <circle cx="570" cy="500" r="9" /><path d="M570 482v36M552 500h36" />
            </g>
            <g stroke="#ead9c4" stroke-width="1.5">
              <rect x="62" y="22" width="24" height="16" fill="#1b2a2f" />
              <rect x="86" y="22" width="24" height="16" fill="#b98b5e" />
              <rect x="110" y="22" width="24" height="16" fill="#c63b1f" />
              <rect x="134" y="22" width="24" height="16" fill="#ead9c4" />
              <rect x="158" y="22" width="24" height="16" fill="#fbf8f2" />
            </g>
            <g class="hero-labels">
              <rect x="-160" y="390" width="580" height="104" fill="#ead9c4" />
              <path d="M144 394v96M278 394v96" stroke="#1b2a2f" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 5" />
              <g transform="translate(18 402)"><rect width="118" height="80" rx="16" fill="#fbf8f2" stroke="#1b2a2f" stroke-width="2" /><text x="14" y="32" class="hero-label-text">Soap</text><rect x="14" y="44" width="72" height="5" fill="#b98b5e" /><rect x="14" y="56" width="48" height="5" fill="#b98b5e" /></g>
              <g transform="translate(152 402)"><rect width="118" height="80" rx="16" fill="#fbf8f2" stroke="#1b2a2f" stroke-width="2" /><text x="14" y="32" class="hero-label-text">Candle</text><rect x="14" y="44" width="72" height="5" fill="#b98b5e" /><rect x="14" y="56" width="48" height="5" fill="#1b2a2f" /></g>
              <g transform="translate(286 402)"><rect width="118" height="80" rx="16" fill="#fbf8f2" stroke="#1b2a2f" stroke-width="2" /><text x="14" y="32" class="hero-label-text">Jam</text><rect x="14" y="44" width="72" height="5" fill="#b98b5e" /><rect x="14" y="56" width="48" height="5" fill="#b98b5e" /></g>
            </g>
            <g class="hero-roll">
              <circle cx="420" cy="218" r="172" fill="#fbf8f2" stroke="#ead9c4" stroke-width="3" />
              <g class="hero-spin">
                <circle cx="420" cy="218" r="160" fill="none" stroke="#1b2a2f" stroke-width="6" stroke-dasharray="2 18" />
                <g class="hero-rings" fill="none" stroke="#b98b5e" stroke-width="1.5">
                  <circle class="hero-ring" pathLength="100" cx="420" cy="218" r="146" /><circle class="hero-ring" pathLength="100" cx="420" cy="218" r="130" /><circle class="hero-ring" pathLength="100" cx="420" cy="218" r="114" /><circle class="hero-ring" pathLength="100" cx="420" cy="218" r="98" /><circle class="hero-ring" pathLength="100" cx="420" cy="218" r="82" />
                </g>
              </g>
              <circle cx="420" cy="218" r="64" fill="#b98b5e" stroke="#1b2a2f" stroke-width="3" />
              <circle cx="420" cy="218" r="40" fill="#1b2a2f" stroke="#ead9c4" stroke-width="2" />
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="shell work">
        <div class="frame">
          <div class="press">
            <Calculator />
            <aside class="result-key" aria-labelledby="guide-title">
              <h2 id="guide-title">Reading your result</h2>
              <p><strong>Rolls to order:</strong> What you need to buy. <strong>Labels to print, with allowance:</strong> Your batch plus the extra %. <strong>Rolls this batch uses:</strong> Including the ones on your shelf. <strong>Spare labels on those rolls:</strong> What's left on the last roll.</p>
            </aside>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="shell notes">
        <section class="explain" aria-labelledby="how">
          <h2 id="how">The math, out in the open</h2>
          <div>
            <p>Multiply your items by labels per item, add the allowance percentage and round up to a whole label. Divide by the labels on each roll and round up to whole rolls. Then subtract the full rolls you already have.</p>
            <p class="example">Example: 250 items × 2 labels = 500, plus 5% = 525 labels. At 500 labels per roll that is 2 rolls. With 1 on the shelf, order 1.</p>
            <p class="fine">The allowance is extra stock, not a yield-loss rate. Results assume identical full rolls. Check your printer's setup needs and any partly used rolls separately.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
    <SiteFooter mode={config.mode} />
  </body>
</html>
